@startuml
title State Diagram — HU4: Public Booking (End Customer ↔ System ↔ Email messages)

' Refines the context-state PUBLIC_BOOKING (HU4).
' Actors: End Customer <-> System; System -> Email Provider (OTP).

state "SELECTING_SERVICE" as service
state "CHECKING_AVAILABILITY" as availability
state "SELECTING_SLOT" as slot
state "FILLING_DATA" as data
state "SLOT_PENDING\n(slot temporarily locked)" as pending
state "SLOT_UNAVAILABLE\n(concurrency conflict)" as unavailable

[*] --> service : Customer→System: openWidget

service --> availability : Customer→System: selectServiceAndEmployee
availability --> slot : System→Customer: showSlots\n[response < 200 ms]

slot --> data : Customer→System: chooseSlot
slot --> unavailable : System→Customer: slotUnavailable\n[locked by another customer]
unavailable --> availability : Customer→System: chooseAnotherSlot

data --> pending : Customer→System: submitData(name, email, phone)\n[valid data] / System: lockSlot(Pending)
data --> data : System→Customer: validationError\n[invalid email format]

pending --> [*] : System→Email: sendOTPCode\n/ startVerification (HU5)

note right of pending
  HU4 ends by leaving the slot in
  "Pending" state and starting the
  OTP verification flow (HU5).
end note
@enduml
